      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Reflecting back on this post, I should've probably added some further descriptions regarding the filters, as to not leave any ambiguity. However, now it's a bit too late to edit the post, so I'll leave this comment as a postscript.\nNormal filter:\nDisplays the surface/vertex directions of every triangle, and also some way to tell backfaces apart, whether that be a different color or some other visual.\nWireframe filter:\nA wireframe which displays the edges of all the triangles on the meshes, allowing for easier analysis of the topology and the complexity of them.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
