      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Disagree. Debug filters should be done via specialist avatars. There's already too many issues in VRC where world authors are gimped because of VRC design: the code camera view was exploited almost entirely for its \"see in pitch black\" magical properties and it shouldn't be on the camera, which is supposed to be used for actually taking photos.\n(If it comes back it really isn't the end of the world but it deserves to be said)\nIMO, if there's a need for debugging features, it should be built into the debugging tools in the game, not into random features.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
