      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a9de400f3791b4155afcc5b|full_name}: i see your point there but cheaters will be cheaters people like that tend to get clientsand stupid stuff like that eventually anyway. i think those 2 cameras would be nice for more than just debugging to they look cool and are fun to mess with. along with the shader method to get wirefram will never be as good as it being actually implemented. and being able to take a picture of a issue with someones avatar to send to them will help to. like i understand the code one going away as it was basically only used for that. but these 2 camera options are both fun to mess with and really usefull. but this is only my opinion",
